    "explanation": "`@SpringBootApplication` is a meta-annotation that combines:\n1. **`@EnableAutoConfiguration`:** Enables the Spring Boot auto-configuration mechanism (guessing and configuring beans based on classpath).\n2. **`@ComponentScan`:** Enables component scanning for the package where the main class is located, finding your `@Service`, `@Controller`, etc.\n3. **`@SpringBootConfiguration`:** A specialized version of `@Configuration` that marks the main class as a source of bean definitions.",
