    "mistake": "Putting complex database queries directly inside the Controller class. The Controller should only route traffic; the Model (Services/Repositories) should handle the heavy lifting.",
    "summary": "A design pattern that separates application logic into Data/Rules (Model), Presentation (View), and Request Routing (Controller)."
