    "mistake": "Claiming ORM makes queries faster than native JDBC. ORMs add processing overhead; they optimize for developer speed, not raw machine execution speed.",
    "summary": "Massively speeds up development, prevents SQL injection, provides caching, and makes the application database-agnostic."
