    "explanation": "`JpaRepository` is an interface provided by the Spring Data JPA module. \nIt extends `PagingAndSortingRepository` (which extends `CrudRepository`). When you create an interface that extends `JpaRepository`, Spring Data automatically generates the implementation class for you at runtime.\nIt instantly provides you with dozens of ready-to-use database methods like `save()`, `findAll()`, `findById()`, and `deleteById()`, completely eliminating the need to write DAO boilerplate code.",
