    "explanation": "`CascadeType.ALL` is a shortcut that applies every single cascade operation (`PERSIST`, `MERGE`, `REMOVE`, `REFRESH`, `DETACH`) to the associated entities.\nIt essentially means the child's lifecycle is completely bound to the parent. If the parent is saved, save the child. If the parent is updated, update the child. If the parent is deleted, delete the child.",
