    "explanation": "`@SpringBootTest` is a Spring Boot annotation used strictly for Integration Testing.\nWhen you place this on a test class, it tells Spring to completely boot up the entire Application Context, just as if you were starting the app normally. It initializes the database connections, loads all beans, configures security, and prepares the environment for full end-to-end testing.",
