    "explanation": "`@MockBean` is a Spring Boot testing annotation. \nIt is used during Integration Tests (when the Spring Context is running) to rip out a real bean from the Spring Context and replace it with a Mockito Mock.\nThis is crucial when you want to do an integration test, but you want to fake exactly one external system (like a third-party Stripe payment API).",
