    "tip": "Aiming for 100% coverage is often a waste of time and money (diminishing returns). The industry standard for enterprise apps is usually 80%.",
    "mistake": "Writing tests with zero assertions just to \"hit\" the code and boost the coverage percentage. This is called \"vanity coverage\" and is highly dangerous.",
